    any legal entity that has two or more of (i) an average of at least 250 employees during its last fiscal year; (ii) a total balance
    sheet of more than &euro;43,000,000 (as shown on its last annual unconsolidated or consolidated financial statements) and (iii) an
    annual net turnover of more than &euro;50,000,000 (as shown on its last annual unconsolidated or consolidated financial statements);</FONT></TD></TR>

<TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
